================================================================================
CIRCUIT MODELS
================================================================================

The device models in source/CelineEngine/Components/ are implementations of
published equations fitted to manufacturer datasheets. Equations are not
copyrightable and no third-party code was used, but the sources are credited in
each header and are worth reading before trusting a result:

  Norman Koren's valve models .. https://www.normankoren.com/Audio/index.html
  Dempwolf and Zolzer .......... "A physically-motivated triode model for
                                 circuit simulations", DAFx-11

Datasheet-derived parameters are attributed in the header that uses them.
